# Root-local workspace files. Blocks every root dot-directory (.claude/, .planning/,
# .beans/, .worktrees/) and every root markdown file (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, HANDOFF.md,
# session notes) without naming them. Add a specific !/<name> rule to opt a file in.
/.*/
/*.md
!/.github/
!/README.md
# Sensitive repo: leave AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md ignored. Shared repo: opt them in.
# !/AGENTS.md
# !/CLAUDE.md
# !/CONTEXT.md
